$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Barton deoxygenation of 11a: Preparation of Taxa-4 (20),
11(12)-dien-10β-tert-butyldimetylsilyloxy-5α-ol (12a). To a solution of
11a (14.9 mg, 0.025 mmol) in toluene (1 mL), AIBN (cat.) and nBu3SnH (66
μmol, 0.25 mmol) were added. The mixture was stirred at reflux
temperature for 3h. The reaction mixture was concentrated and purified by
chromatography (silica gel, eluted with hexanes/EtOAc, 9: 1), yielding
crude 12a (7.6 mg, 0.018 mmol, 73%). [α]20D =+86 (c 0.0022, CHCl3); IR
(NaCl): 3417, 2927, 1644, 1379, 1362, 1336, 1257, 1199, 1047, 952, 926,
869, 834, 677 cm-1; 1H NMR (300 MHz, C6D5) δ5.20 (1H, dd, J= 5.8 Hz, 11.5
Hz, H-10), 4.80 (1H, s, H-20), 4.59 (1H, s, H-20), 3.94 (1H, dd , J= 2.5
Hz, 3.3 Hz, H-S), 3.13 (1H, d, J= 4.9 Hz, H-3), 2.41 (1H, dd, J= 11.5 Hz,
14.7 Hz, H-13), 2.41 OH, dd, J= 11.5 Hz, 14.7 Hz, H-9), 2.29 OH, dddd, J=
1.1 Hz, 4.7 Hz, 12.8 Hz, 13.0 Hz, H-13), 2.02 (2H, m, H-1 and H-14), 1.97
(3H, d, J= 1.1 Hz, Me-18), 1.88 (1H, ddd, J= 3.0 Hz, 10.4 Hz, 18.2 Hz,
H-7), 1.70 (3H, s, Me-17), 1.72-1.30 (5H, m, H-2, H-6, H-9), 1.29 (1H,
ddd, J= 4.6 Hz, 10.1 Hz, 14.3 Hz, H-14), 1.22 (3H, s, Me-16), 1.00 (1H,
m, H-7), 1.10 (9H, s, t-Bu), 0.66 (3H, s, Me-19),0.19 (3H, s, MeSi) and
0.18 (3H, s, MeSi); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CD3CN) δ156.89, 139.03, 139.77,
133.03, 108.76, 74.66, 69.11, 49.86, 44.96, 39.49, 39.26, 35.07, 34.05,
32.67, 30.92, 30.88, 29.10, 26.53, 26.36, 23.76, 22.32, 21.57,
18.71,-3.72,-4.1; HR-FABMAS calcd. for C26H46O2Si (M+) 418.3267, found
418.3265.
